{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X的快速扫读不如Y：上下交替的叙述与感受需要反复切换视线，Y左右分栏更容易迅速抓住主线。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X用放大加亮的关键词让每段情绪重点更容易被抓住，而且感受随音乐分段出现，能让观众看到靠近、退缩、盼望、害怕失去到接受当下的细微变化。Y的叙述更顺畅，因果关系也更容易直接读懂，但感受描写的层次、音乐细节与情绪变化之间的对应不如X丰富。综合考虑，X虽然扫读稍费力，却更能让人感到这是一段随着音乐逐渐展开、前后连贯的真实心理经历。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "1ef77d1e-1c9a-4d34-a929-b94647a0ca53", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T053403638053Z", "elapsed_seconds": 163.922, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T05:36:50.302197+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "618e5e509ce0932b2f0dad187feba45cc4ee3557dd7488ac6e1fdb68d4fe84c1", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa